data.explanation:
$$
f(x) = (x^{2} + 2ax + 4a^{2} + 1)g(x) + \left[2a(4a^{2} + 1) - 3a\right]x + b - 2(4a^{2} + 1),
$$

$g(x)$  整除  $f(x)$ ,故  
$$
\left\{ 
\begin{array}{l}
2a(4a^{2} + 1) - 3a = 0 \\
b - 2(4a^{2} + 1) = 0 
\end{array} 
\right.
$$

求解,可得  
$$
\left\{ 
\begin{array}{l}
a = 0 \\
b = 2 
\end{array} 
\right.
\quad \text{或} \quad 
\left\{ 
\begin{array}{l}
a = \pm \frac{\sqrt{2}}{4} \\
b = 3 
\end{array} 
\right.
$$
